WHY THESE TERMS

tripps reads several transport operators' endpoints that are unofficial and undocumented,
and it presents timetable and fare data that those operators own. Personal use is one thing;
systematic extraction and redisplay is another, and would need each source's terms — and
Swedish katalogskydd / the EU database right — looked at properly first. These terms keep
that question where it belongs: with anyone who wants to go further than personal use, and
who should ask first.

The GTFS Sweden feed this software downloads is licensed CC0 by its publisher and is not
covered by these terms. Third-party Python dependencies carry their own licenses.

